title: Logging, metrics and lake pipeline {near: top-center; shape: text; style.font-size: 22}
direction: right

apps: Services {
  ext: api-ext (structlog)
  int: api-int (structlog)
  rater: raters (Powertools)
  jobs: jobs (structlog)
}
cwl: CloudWatch Logs (Standard class, 30d) {shape: cylinder}
cwm: CloudWatch Metrics (EMF extraction)
alarms: CloudWatch Alarms -> SNS -> paging/chat
insights: Logs Insights (hot queries)
fh: Data Firehose (decompress + extract + partition)
raw: S3 raw JSON.gz (service/dt) {shape: stored_data}
curated: S3 curated Parquet + daily aggregates {shape: stored_data}
exp: S3 exports (Postgres, Parquet) {shape: stored_data}
pg: Postgres {shape: cylinder}
athena: Glue Catalog + Athena (workgroup limits)

apps -> cwl: JSON lines (+EMF)
cwl -> cwm
cwm -> alarms
cwl -> insights
cwl -> fh: subscription filter
fh -> raw
raw -> curated: Athena CTAS (scheduled)
pg -> exp: daily incremental export
curated -> athena
exp -> athena
raw -> athena
